UsmRegistry::getUsmAtIndex(uint256)
├── given USM list is empty
│   └── when index is 0
│       └── it should revert with UsmRegistryInvalidIndex
├── given USM list has USMs
│   ├── when index is greater than or equal to USM list length
│   │   └── it should revert with UsmRegistryInvalidIndex
│   └── when index is less than USM list length
│       └── it should return the USM at the given index
